WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.470 --> 00:00:03.450
Yesterday I visited Lake
Atitlán with my family.

2
00:00:03.470 --> 00:00:05.250
We went across the lake by boat.

3
00:00:05.470 --> 00:00:07.890
I saw three volcanoes!

4
00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:10.370
We ate fish and tortillas for lunch.

5
00:00:10.483 --> 00:00:13.810
In the evening, I was tired but very happy.
